        <mxCell id="c276" value="&lt;i&gt;The model answer (18 tables, 16 relationships, all active and single direction). Each table lists some of its columns. The five fact tables and LaborPaths each relate to Date; Item, Account and CostCenter each filter two fact tables. Steps, Discount and Plant Measure hold a type-in table and two parameters, and Key Measures holds the measures; none has a line.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="636" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
